+{
+  "parent_document_id": "DF-RVW-002",
+  "report_edition": "1.0/60",
+  "date": "2026-10-15",
+  "step": "4.19",
+  "phase": "REVIEW",
+  "input_package_sha256": "1ceb49c9022c1d6936d99b2ae55c708b8d4251c2bc2475e46291b83beb08729f",
+  "source_path": "02-Documentation/DocumentIdentity/03-Behavior/DF-DID-006 - Document Identity Lifecycle.md",
+  "source_sha256": "daac70f4f6a8b3fa177a71e4f4e5f89bc93951ef6bf3529bdcbf950c01eba024",
+  "source_bytes": 9353,
+  "source_unchanged": true,
+  "received_edition": "V1.0 R0;Family Documentation;Type Behavior;Component Document Identity;Author Arnaldo Figueira;Canonical/Baseline1.0;English",
+  "coverage": "Complete13 chapters/all numbered bodies;4 states/5 principles/7 events/8 transition rows/7 document-status rows/6 component interactions/6 constraints/5 dependencies/5 fenced blocks;selected peers only",
+  "section_map": [
+    {
+      "number": "1",
+      "title": "Purpose",
+      "body": "\n\nThis document defines the architectural lifecycle of a **Document Identity** within the Documentation Framework.\n\nIts purpose is to describe the lifecycle of the identity itself, independently of the lifecycle of the document, its content, metadata, governance, storage, or implementation.\n\nThe Document Identity Lifecycle specifies the architectural events that affect the existence of a document identity while preserving its permanence and stability.\n\n---\n\n",
+      "body_sha256_utf8": "0550ca9cea7f512638ae54e127ad77eea37af34923fe2644034840b702745e85"
+    },
+    {
+      "number": "2",
+      "title": "Introduction",
+      "body": "\n\nEvery document managed by the Documentation Framework possesses exactly one permanent identity.\n\nUnlike documents, whose content, metadata, classification, governance state, and storage location may evolve over time, the identity itself follows a minimal and stable lifecycle.\n\nOnce established, a document identity becomes the permanent architectural reference for that document throughout its entire existence.\n\n---\n\n",
+      "body_sha256_utf8": "b39bbfbb4c9cfbcfa1eda751a81c486ae042f15c8652788d591045630a08cc41"
+    },
+    {
+      "number": "3",
+      "title": "Lifecycle Principles",
+      "body": "\n\nThe lifecycle of a document identity is governed by the following principles.\n\n",
+      "body_sha256_utf8": "7225aad97157a8c228141484005462fe8e4a9483053d7d6fd0fbd52188e94180"
+    },
+    {
+      "number": "3.1",
+      "title": "Permanence",
+      "body": "\n\nOnce assigned, a document identity shall remain associated with the same document for its entire lifetime.\n\n---\n\n",
+      "body_sha256_utf8": "06e56917a21fd42b213e8a10d64f9529c5789c81fb4e13e6b4cd3f989d99863e"
+    },
+    {
+      "number": "3.2",
+      "title": "Immutability",
+      "body": "\n\nThe identity shall never be modified.\n\nOnly the document associated with the identity may evolve.\n\n---\n\n",
+      "body_sha256_utf8": "1507866b64c49b3918bee6bb121c6012c86937570ff1aef2a1da46bf7a59c929"
+    },
+    {
+      "number": "3.3",
+      "title": "Uniqueness",
+      "body": "\n\nAn identity shall never be reused for another document.\n\n---\n\n",
+      "body_sha256_utf8": "3dd5bad0ff66c3d6d97adeeaef805d35c463e5cde53c31bf5dc2b2b551890b9e"
+    },
+    {
+      "number": "3.4",
+      "title": "Independence",
+      "body": "\n\nThe lifecycle of the identity is independent of:\n\n- document content;\n- metadata;\n- classification;\n- governance;\n- repository;\n- storage technology;\n- implementation.\n\n---\n\n",
+      "body_sha256_utf8": "7b058c07d4266b4f4d25a07b2ef0ff31f7ba09534e7768461bfe0e9bfd7147da"
+    },
+    {
+      "number": "3.5",
+      "title": "Traceability",
+      "body": "\n\nA document identity shall remain suitable for long-term architectural reference.\n\n---\n\n",
+      "body_sha256_utf8": "a3c39ce5fed245933e68cd36cbdbf42769731945052c5ae7dffbb7310189d6a8"
+    },
+    {
+      "number": "4",
+      "title": "Lifecycle States",
+      "body": "\n\nA document identity progresses through the following conceptual states.\n\n```text\n\n                    ┌───────────────────┐\n                    │     Unassigned    │\n                    └───────────────────┘\n                              │\n                              ▼\n\n                    ┌───────────────────┐\n                    │      Assigned     │\n                    └───────────────────┘\n                              │\n                              ▼\n\n                    ┌───────────────────┐\n                    │     Preserved     │\n                    └───────────────────┘\n                              │\n                              ▼\n\n                    ┌───────────────────┐\n                    │      Retired      │\n                    └───────────────────┘\n```\n\nThese states describe the existence of the identity, not the operational state of the document.\n\n---\n\n",
+      "body_sha256_utf8": "cf06458d30251356f34331884d4f3698939387a704fbbd2706a8e821afddde63"
+    },
+    {
+      "number": "5",
+      "title": "State Definitions",
+      "body": "\n\n",
+      "body_sha256_utf8": "75a11da44c802486bc6f65640aa48a730f0f684c5c07a42ba3cd1735eb3fb070"
+    },
+    {
+      "number": "5.1",
+      "title": "Unassigned",
+      "body": "\n\n",
+      "body_sha256_utf8": "75a11da44c802486bc6f65640aa48a730f0f684c5c07a42ba3cd1735eb3fb070"
+    },
+    {
+      "number": "5.1.1",
+      "title": "Description",
+      "body": "\n\nThe document does not yet possess a document identity.\n\n",
+      "body_sha256_utf8": "1e68a678ee959751f6464a9605f70a82d592c11bfc1901fe241d9fc18ff6ec22"
+    },
+    {
+      "number": "5.1.2",
+      "title": "Characteristics",
+      "body": "\n\n- temporary;\n- identity does not exist;\n- no references are permitted.\n\n",
+      "body_sha256_utf8": "e6c654c016e41e2d3af9e9bf7ac26a1f6d4232568c3f1c4424f69598b0957355"
+    },
+    {
+      "number": "5.1.3",
+      "title": "Allowed Transition",
+      "body": "\n\n```text\nUnassigned → Assigned\n```\n\n---\n\n",
+      "body_sha256_utf8": "23217e83b0b395ca8144c1fe6299e9902bb101270cf3886a10f8ecf6ac1233cf"
+    },
+    {
+      "number": "5.2",
+      "title": "Assigned",
+      "body": "\n\n",
+      "body_sha256_utf8": "75a11da44c802486bc6f65640aa48a730f0f684c5c07a42ba3cd1735eb3fb070"
+    },
+    {
+      "number": "5.2.1",
+      "title": "Description",
+      "body": "\n\nA permanent identity has been associated with the document.\n\nThe document becomes uniquely identifiable within its identity domain.\n\n",
+      "body_sha256_utf8": "230e72241357012e034f8a8b259f018fc9e7d244ab4b81f186ffad9003266ddb"
+    },
+    {
+      "number": "5.2.2",
+      "title": "Characteristics",
+      "body": "\n\n- identity exists;\n- immutable;\n- globally referenceable;\n- unique.\n\n",
+      "body_sha256_utf8": "9b84c26eb5d1d1a9d27cdaff026385a486536552295d057484507c6f16881d98"
+    },
+    {
+      "number": "5.2.3",
+      "title": "Allowed Transition",
+      "body": "\n\n```text\nAssigned → Preserved\n```\n\n---\n\n",
+      "body_sha256_utf8": "397e5aff8e18285c80b03814072a4cb4b98651f7f3d544b546abd68fe76987e0"
+    },
+    {
+      "number": "5.3",
+      "title": "Preserved",
+      "body": "\n\n",
+      "body_sha256_utf8": "75a11da44c802486bc6f65640aa48a730f0f684c5c07a42ba3cd1735eb3fb070"
+    },
+    {
+      "number": "5.3.1",
+      "title": "Description",
+      "body": "\n\nThe document continues to evolve while maintaining the same identity.\n\nAll modifications to the document preserve the assigned identity.\n\nExamples include:\n\n- metadata updates;\n- content revisions;\n- edition creation;\n- classification changes;\n- repository migration;\n- format conversion;\n- governance transitions.\n\nNone of these operations affect the identity.\n\n",
+      "body_sha256_utf8": "604f7b6708f86f58cc04f2e839ec2b4dd82ae1595865cd0bd9dfd6a99dfcbba6"
+    },
+    {
+      "number": "5.3.2",
+      "title": "Allowed Transition",
+      "body": "\n\n```text\nPreserved → Retired\n```\n\n---\n\n",
+      "body_sha256_utf8": "e7bebb2f177d89dfda47d4339c0bd12a70d683a618e2e9ae9736bcb0a21bf5fe"
+    },
+    {
+      "number": "5.4",
+      "title": "Retired",
+      "body": "\n\n",
+      "body_sha256_utf8": "75a11da44c802486bc6f65640aa48a730f0f684c5c07a42ba3cd1735eb3fb070"
+    },
+    {
+      "number": "5.4.1",
+      "title": "Description",
+      "body": "\n\nThe document identity is no longer associated with an active document within the architectural scope.\n\nThe identity is permanently retired.\n\nRetirement does **not** permit identity reuse.\n\nHistorical references remain valid.\n\n",
+      "body_sha256_utf8": "2958a798db3b57fd5d885346460d600cd3786966d5ae59fba45c0a06d778c23b"
+    },
+    {
+      "number": "5.4.2",
+      "title": "Characteristics",
+      "body": "\n\n- immutable;\n- non-reusable;\n- historically valid;\n- permanently reserved.\n\n---\n\n",
+      "body_sha256_utf8": "026b0a1603925c5b73a75620883a76c5c9a45630fa823a6beecab25785b8c61c"
+    },
+    {
+      "number": "6",
+      "title": "Lifecycle Events",
+      "body": "\n\nThe lifecycle is driven by the following architectural events.\n\n| Event | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| Identity Assignment | A new identity is associated with a document. |\n| Document Evolution | The document changes while preserving its identity. |\n| Repository Migration | The document moves without changing identity. |\n| Metadata Evolution | Metadata changes without affecting identity. |\n| Classification Evolution | Classification changes without affecting identity. |\n| Governance Evolution | Governance processes preserve identity. |\n| Identity Retirement | The identity is permanently retired. |\n\n---\n\n",
+      "body_sha256_utf8": "6a27c2db4133b6d2dc85d9ebf1a77490be231b396ce9b5c36bcddbe8e7a5ee80"
+    },
+    {
+      "number": "7",
+      "title": "Lifecycle State Transitions",
+      "body": "\n\n| Current State | Event | Next State |\n|---------------|-------|------------|\n| Unassigned | Identity Assignment | Assigned |\n| Assigned | Document Evolution | Preserved |\n| Preserved | Content Revision | Preserved |\n| Preserved | Metadata Update | Preserved |\n| Preserved | Classification Update | Preserved |\n| Preserved | Repository Migration | Preserved |\n| Preserved | Governance Transition | Preserved |\n| Preserved | Identity Retirement | Retired |\n\nNo other transitions are permitted.\n\n---\n\n",
+      "body_sha256_utf8": "990502a57ab32bb7e579fb12cd2023c225106c89a6af7360985e792bef82d1dc"
+    },
+    {
+      "number": "8",
+      "title": "Relationship with Document Lifecycle",
+      "body": "\n\nThe Document Identity Lifecycle is distinct from the lifecycle of a document.\n\n| Document Lifecycle | Identity Lifecycle |\n|--------------------|-------------------|\n| Draft | Assigned / Preserved |\n| Review | Preserved |\n| Approved | Preserved |\n| Published | Preserved |\n| Archived | Preserved |\n| Obsolete | Preserved |\n| Deleted | Retired |\n\nThe operational state of the document never determines the identity.\n\n---\n\n",
+      "body_sha256_utf8": "5330642e332ad2f66d12aefb24e30b94a15f024679b0ed59c6a4c4e7838de82f"
+    },
+    {
+      "number": "9",
+      "title": "Relationship with Other Components",
+      "body": "\n\n",
+      "body_sha256_utf8": "75a11da44c802486bc6f65640aa48a730f0f684c5c07a42ba3cd1735eb3fb070"
+    },
+    {
+      "number": "9.1",
+      "title": "Metadata",
+      "body": "\n\nMetadata evolves independently while preserving identity.\n\n---\n\n",
+      "body_sha256_utf8": "95a70b97502436771204983bb784045a3c926ef1db954955d96e6de465643d66"
+    },
+    {
+      "number": "9.2",
+      "title": "Classification",
+      "body": "\n\nClassification changes do not affect identity.\n\n---\n\n",
+      "body_sha256_utf8": "eabcf6b37e48de7f2183320e9c626d77a9419017edccc90bc277a794b4fad21a"
+    },
+    {
+      "number": "9.3",
+      "title": "Governance",
+      "body": "\n\nGovernance processes preserve identity throughout the document lifecycle.\n\n---\n\n",
+      "body_sha256_utf8": "0d56514297967fae76ea0ad3fc070f540851349487e023d16536331ecdb9b990"
+    },
+    {
+      "number": "9.4",
+      "title": "Registry",
+      "body": "\n\nRegistry entries continue to reference the same identity.\n\n---\n\n",
+      "body_sha256_utf8": "7b095caf48010caa4b57b3c71a004d86016bb022b85a72dbd216ba79330b6950"
+    },
+    {
+      "number": "9.5",
+      "title": "Relationships",
+      "body": "\n\nRelationships remain valid because document identities are stable.\n\n---\n\n",
+      "body_sha256_utf8": "77c773bb9dd2b8f4b30770f2d099094e4ac1e658cc915942f3932030c903ebac"
+    },
+    {
+      "number": "9.6",
+      "title": "Knowledge Graph",
+      "body": "\n\nGraph nodes representing document identities remain unchanged throughout the lifecycle.\n\n---\n\n",
+      "body_sha256_utf8": "ec4e9789c67b928649d0668d6dbcea46a27e0ba5cc6134dc73e8dcff9b6580d7"
+    },
+    {
+      "number": "10",
+      "title": "Architectural Constraints",
+      "body": "\n\nThe lifecycle shall satisfy the following constraints.\n\n- An identity shall be assigned only once.\n- An identity shall never change.\n- An identity shall never be duplicated.\n- An identity shall never be reused.\n- Retirement shall not invalidate historical references.\n- Identity shall remain independent of implementation technologies.\n\n---\n\n",
+      "body_sha256_utf8": "5570649f2059e2a3d322b2391af0939db9135f5777f926fda882640b02d61f3d"
+    },
+    {
+      "number": "11",
+      "title": "Lifecycle Overview",
+      "body": "\n\n```text\n\n            Document Created\n                    │\n                    ▼\n\n            Identity Assigned\n                    │\n                    ▼\n\n       Document Evolves Repeatedly\n                    │\n                    ▼\n\n            Identity Preserved\n                    │\n                    ▼\n\n            Document Retired\n                    │\n                    ▼\n\n            Identity Retired\n\n```\n\nThroughout the lifecycle:\n\n- the identifier remains unchanged;\n- references remain valid;\n- uniqueness is preserved;\n- ownership remains with the Document Identity component.\n\n---\n\n",
+      "body_sha256_utf8": "64b78ce5270b0349b17f1e4f64fb74e37b89e74ebcaead21e386810b6561aca8"
+    },
+    {
+      "number": "12",
+      "title": "Dependencies",
+      "body": "\n\nThis document depends upon:\n\n- DF-DID-001 — Document Identity Architecture\n- DF-DID-002 — Document Identity Concepts\n- DF-DID-003 — Document Identity Model\n- DF-DID-004 — Document Identity Elements\n- DF-DID-005 — Document Identity Schema\n\n---\n\n",
+      "body_sha256_utf8": "3a258cea71e49b745f818a2d7f5800fb864d726da70c2535e09c365bf5e34b7f"
+    },
+    {
+      "number": "13",
+      "title": "Summary",
+      "body": "\n\nThe Document Identity Lifecycle defines the canonical lifecycle of document identities within the Documentation Framework.\n\nUnlike documents, whose operational states may change over time, document identities follow a minimal lifecycle that guarantees permanence, uniqueness, immutability, and long-term traceability.\n\nThis lifecycle ensures that document identities remain stable architectural references regardless of document evolution, governance processes, repository migrations, or implementation technologies.\n\n---\n\n**End of Document**\n\n---",
+      "body_sha256_utf8": "96eb449d5a26eb58e0b9b5c258664b90ab1390287fc8f036156215968e5e95a6"
+    }
+  ],
