+          "text": "# 6. Metadata Abstraction Levels\n\nThe Metadata component is organized into successive abstraction levels.\n\n```text\n\n                 Level 1\n            Metadata Concepts\n                    ↓\n\n                 Level 2\n              Metadata Model\n                    ↓\n\n                 Level 3\n             Metadata Schema\n                    ↓\n\n                 Level 4\n            Metadata Profiles\n                    ↓\n\n                 Level 5\n            Metadata Instances\n\n```\n\nEach level refines the previous one without altering its semantics.\n\n---\n\n"
